# Master SDK Catalog

Use this catalog to find shared SDK information for your application platform. **Auth SDK is the only entry included at this stage.** Additional SDKs will be added after discussion with the responsible teams.

> **Confidential — internal use only.** Keep SDK documentation, private package locations, configuration, and access information within approved company systems. Never include credentials or signing material in this catalog.

## Auth SDK

The Auth SDK entry is reserved for the team's approved authentication integration. Package identity, supported capabilities, compatibility, and usage instructions have not yet been supplied. The entries below are placeholders, not installation instructions or confirmation of a published SDK for each platform.

